          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kent.schwartz@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Feb 02 2024 20:04:57 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">The Michael Graves Story</span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Designed in partnership with the Michael Graves Design Group, the open and welcoming aesthetics of the Michael Graves with Stryker furniture line visually communicates cleanliness, healing, and an enhanced level of care. The Michael Graves furniture line was created to enhance the patient experience by decreasing the clutter of the hospital room while making each item easy to use and accessible to the patient.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Overbed Table</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Bedside Stand</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Patient Chair</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Feb 02 2024 20:05:39 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
