          "jcr:created": "Fri Feb 28 2020 17:00:49 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Removable Liners</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Removable plastic drawer liners make the stand easy to clean. Remove liners without detaching drawers for a simple solution to moving patient belongings.</span></p>\n",
