          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Hospitality Handles</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Combined with a sleek look, and less bulk, beautifully crafted Hospitality Handles allow caregivers and patients to more easily position the furniture for maximum use.</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Feb 02 2024 20:14:40 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
