          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kent.schwartz@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Feb 28 2020 17:00:49 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Intuitive Design</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">An intuitive activation handle allows users to move the table top easily with one hand. Simply push up or down to lift or lower.</span></p>\n",
